Optional MaxMind GeoLite City and ASN data
--------------------------------
This product optionally downloads GeoLite data created by MaxMind, available
from https://www.maxmind.com. It includes geographical data from GeoNames
(https://www.geonames.org). Users supply their own licensed account credentials.
MaxMind databases are not bundled with this software; applicable database
license terms govern their use and redistribution.
